  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 351 ÷ 3 + 284 × 4 - 11 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after ‘+’ and ‘−’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged:\n\n351 ÷ 3 + 284 × 4 - 11 = ? ⇒ 351 × 3 - 284 ÷ 4 + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ 351 × 3 - __**284 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**351 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 71 + 11 = ?\n\n⇒ __**1053 + 11**__ - 71 = ?\n\n⇒ __**1064**____** - 7**____**1**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 993 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
